{"id":"n28956-1-8","stage":3,"title":"직장인 · 上班族","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28956-1-8-1","ko":"회사를 옮길까 고민 중이야.","zh":"我正在考虑要不要换工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회사를","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사를","audio":"/audio/62f80adf2dcac5e0aace.mp3"}},{"text":"옮길까","meaning":"搬，换，调，迁移","explanation":"옮기다：搬，换，调，迁移；ㄹ까：表达犹豫、推测或考虑，连接 보다、하다 等后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"10","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮길까","audio":"/audio/992084cc3ee5489e6af6.mp3"}},{"text":"고민","meaning":"苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","explanation":"고민：苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","readings":[{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19225","senseId":"1","lemma":"고민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}},{"text":"중이야.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이야","audio":"/audio/1aa751351350901e0cb7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，换，调，迁移","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"将原来的住所、所属等换成别的。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]},{"id":"2d27a95090cbb680","term":"고민","zh":"苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3","entryId":"19225","definition":"心里有烦心事而痛苦，一直在意。","pronunciation":["고민"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]}],"audio":"/audio/16dc139797d48bb87a1e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28956-1-8-2","ko":"요즘 직장을 옮기는 직장인들이 늘고 있다고 하더라.","zh":"据说最近选择换工作的上班族越来越多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"직장을","meaning":"工作单位，职场","explanation":"직장：工作单位，职场；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"1","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직장을","audio":"/audio/b79a67e2f0defe312858.mp3"}},{"text":"옮기는","meaning":"搬，换，调，迁移","explanation":"옮기다：搬，换，调，迁移；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"10","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮기는","audio":"/audio/2638362210289f1b2b49.mp3"}},{"text":"직장인들이","meaning":"上班族","explanation":"직장인：上班族；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"직장인","audio":"/audio/2ed202603c1adec3c922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28956","senseId":"1","lemma":"직장인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직장인들이","audio":"/audio/2b93cdea4bf51358aa56.mp3"}},{"text":"늘고","meaning":"增加，上升","explanation":"늘다：增加，上升；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"늘다","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64492","senseId":"2","lemma":"늘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘고","au